# Secrets for compliance-reviewer (local-compliance-reviewer container).
# Copy compliance-reviewer.env.example to compliance-reviewer.env, uncomment the credentials you use,
# and replace their placeholder values. At least one credential is required.
# Passed to the container at runtime by Compose (env_file); it is not copied into the image.

# --- Claude Code (tool "claude"). Set ONE of these; if both are set, the API key wins.
# Anthropic Console API key (billed per token):
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=<anthropic-api-key>
# Claude subscription token, created on your PC with: claude setup-token
# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=<claude-oauth-token>

# --- GitHub Copilot CLI (tool "copilot").
# Fine-grained personal access token with the "Copilot Requests" permission:
# COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN=<github-token>

# --- Optional API overrides (defaults shown); see the API README for every COMP_REVIEW_API_* setting.
# COMP_REVIEW_API_DEFAULT_TOOL=auto
# COMP_REVIEW_API_DEFAULT_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5
# COMP_REVIEW_API_MAX_CONCURRENT_JOBS=1
# COMP_REVIEW_API_REVIEW_TIMEOUT_MIN=60
# COMP_REVIEW_API_TEST_TIMEOUT_MIN=60
